      "- **FIX-D9:** dispositions written, nothing deleted; the packet slot for the dark trio is Register VII's wiring car (chartered when the owner signs `REGISTER_VII_SIGNATURE`); `tests/lint/deadCodeDisposition.walker.test.js` minted; §934.70 asks keep-dark vs retire with the table.\n"
      "- **FIX-B3 (NEW; FIX-B2's family, after B2 lands):** `ENGINE_SHARED_DOMAIN` seeded from the REACHABLE graph, not every file under `src/generators/` (the dark trio charges first paint by construction: ESD 51 → 49, EAGER 268 → 266 without it); measured with a build; the first-paint budget's honest headroom re-measured.\n"
